    "description": "<p>At 6th level, a <a href=\"/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong\" title=\"Yuuzhan Vong\">Yuuzhan Vong</a> Shaper is expected to replace at least one of their hands with what is known as a Shaper Hand. A Shaper Hand is a bioengineered appendage equipped with a number of tools that assist in tasks specific to Shaping. A Shaper who declines to attach a Shaper Hand when permitted to do so is often viewed with suspicion by other <a href=\"/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong\" title=\"Yuuzhan Vong\">Yuuzhan Vong</a>.</p><p>A Shaper Hand replaces the need for a <a href=\"/wiki/Biotech_Tool_Kit\" title=\"Biotech Tool Kit\">Biotech Tool Kit</a>.</p>",
